  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "1. 负载",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Engine Ops",
      "description": "**面板作用**\nAiDb 引擎全部操作 **ops/s** (与 QPS 同义): get / put / write_batch / stall / snapshot 等.\n\n**指标类型**\nCounter `aidb_operations_total` 的 `rate()`.\n\n**图示**\n- **Total** (粗虚线): 当前过滤下全节点合计\n- **node N**: 按 `node_id` 分线, 看分片倾斜 (含 Raft apply 的 write_batch)\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb → OTLP (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prom remote write\nResource: `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n\n**PromQL**\n`sum(rate(...))` + `sum(rate(...)) by (node_id)`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Total"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "blue",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 3
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(aidb_operations_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "Total",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(aidb_operations_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (node_id)",
          "legendFormat": "node {{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Write stall Ops",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n写路径 **stall 事件** 频率 (ops/s). L0 SST 过多时引擎在 put/delete/write_batch 前主动 sleep/阻塞.\n\n**指标类型**\nCounter 事件计数 (`aidb_operations_total`, `aidb_operation_name=stall_slowdown|stall_stop`). `rate()` = 每秒触发 stall 的写次数, **不是** 写延迟秒数, **不是** Gauge.\n\n**图示/阈值**\n- **Timeseries 折线** (本面板): 正常应 ≈0; 分线看 slowdown vs stop\n- stop 线 >0 → 写几乎被堵住, 优先看 Compaction + L0 文件数\n- slowdown → 写减速, compaction 跟不上\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb → OTLP (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prom remote write\nResource: `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n\n**PromQL**\n`sum(rate(aidb_operations_total{...,aidb_operation_name=~\"stall_.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (aidb_operation_name, node_id)`\n\n**No data**\nCounter 从未 +1 则无 series (正常). 需 L0>8 且 memtable 已 flush.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/stop/"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "red",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/slowdown/"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "orange",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(aidb_operations_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\",aidb_operation_name=~\"stall_.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (aidb_operation_name, node_id) or label_replace(sum by (node_id) (rate(aidb_operations_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 0, \"aidb_operation_name\", \"stall_slowdown\", \"\", \"\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{aidb_operation_name}} n{{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "数据面 Operation p95",
      "description": "**面板作用**\nput / get / delete / write_batch 延迟 P95 (秒).\n\n**图示**\nstall / snapshot 无 histogram, 不在此图.\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb → OTLP (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prom remote write\nResource: `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(aidb_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\",aidb_operation_name=~\"get|put|delete|write_batch\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, aidb_operation_name, node_id))",
          "legendFormat": "{{aidb_operation_name}} n{{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "2. 写路径",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "WAL & MemTable",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n写缓冲: WAL 追加体积 + MemTable (active/frozen).\n\n**图示**\nWAL 持续涨 → flush 跟不上.\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb → OTLP (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prom remote write\nResource: `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "aidb_wal_size_bytes{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}",
          "legendFormat": "wal n{{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "aidb_memtable_size_bytes{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}",
          "legendFormat": "memtable {{aidb_memtable_state}} n{{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Flush",
      "description": "**面板作用**\nMemTable → L0 SST: flush 频率与 P95 耗时.\n\n**图示**\nflush/s + p95; p95 升 → 磁盘或 memtable 过大.\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb → OTLP (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prom remote write\nResource: `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n\n**No data**\nmemtable 未满 (默认 64MB) 不会 flush; counter 无 series 直到首次 flush.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/p95.*/"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(aidb_flush_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (node_id) or (sum by (node_id) (rate(aidb_operations_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 0)",
          "legendFormat": "flush/s n{{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(aidb_flush_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, node_id)) or (sum by (node_id) (rate(aidb_operations_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 0)",
          "legendFormat": "p95 s n{{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "3. 读路径",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Block cache 命中率",
      "description": "**面板作用**\nSST 读 cache 命中比例; miss 高 → 更多读盘.\n\n**图示**\n0–1; 读多场景宜 >80%.\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb → OTLP (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prom remote write\nResource: `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n\n**No data**\n读路径未走 SST Block cache (数据在 MemTable) 时 hit/miss 不产生 series.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(aidb_block_cache_hits_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (node_id) / clamp_min(sum(rate(aidb_block_cache_hits_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (node_id) + sum(rate(aidb_block_cache_misses_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (node_id), 1e-9) or (0 * sum by (node_id) (aidb_memtable_size_bytes{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\",aidb_memtable_state=\"active\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "n{{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Block cache 使用率",
      "description": "**面板作用**\nsize / capacity.\n\n**图示**\n>90% 接近饱和.\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb → OTLP (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prom remote write\nResource: `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n\n**No data**\ncache 无 entry 时 `aidb_block_cache_size_bytes` 无 series.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "aidb_block_cache_size_bytes{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"} / aidb_block_cache_capacity_bytes{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}",
          "legendFormat": "n{{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Block cache miss Ops",
      "description": "**面板作用**\ncache miss 速率 ≈ SST block 读盘次数代理.\n\n**图示**\n与 Engine Ops / get 对照.\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb → OTLP (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prom remote write\nResource: `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
