    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SSTable 文件数",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n各 level SST 文件数; L0 多 → compaction 压力.\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb → OTLP (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prom remote write\nResource: `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n\n**No data**\n需 memtable flush 后才有 L0 SST; gauge 在 flush 时更新.",
